      "description": "This is a popular internet meme format where a person or character is shown laughing while another person or entity is being mocked or ridiculed. The phrase 'laughs in [X]' is used to indicate that the person in the image is amused or smugly confident in the face of the mockery. It is often used to convey a sense of superiority or detachment from the situation being mocked.",
